# Panel Logowania: dist is the production site

test.udomio.com.pl / udomio.com.pl serve the committed/uploaded `dist/` folder, not `src/`. Changing React/CSS without `npm run build` leaves the live panel on the previous bundle.

## After any user-visible change (UI, copy, routing, checkout, dashboard)

1. Run `npm run build` in `Domio-Panel-Logowania`.
2. Confirm `dist/index.html` points at newly hashed `/assets/index-*.js` and `/assets/index-*.css` (hashes must change vs the previous build).
3. Grep `dist/assets` for a unique string from the change (Polish UI copy or a distinctive className). Fail the task if it is missing.
4. Tell the user that `dist/` is ready to upload. Do not claim the live site is updated until that upload happens.

## Do not

- Finish a panel UI task with only `src/` edits.
- Assume Vite dev server or a source commit is what production serves.
